ack": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}], "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "id": 1}], "id": 0}], "type": "RSLT", "template_override": 1, "id": 10}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " IT solutions in enterprises"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}], "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "pdf", "content": "enpe8n3le02ob01re7pdf01.pdf"}], "type": "question"}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "id": 0}], "id": 0}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1, "id": 11}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "template_override": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe8n3le02ob01re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "100", "image": "enpe8n3le02ob01re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<p>In today&rsquo;s session, we are planning to discuss IT solutions for an enterprise. It is necessary to bear in mind that a product or service is a solution that a service provider offers. It is also a value added that a salesperson or a reseller provides to a client with the purpose of addressing a need. For instance, an IT solution provider can recommend a new server or provide maintenance to repair computers or any other device. The IT solutions department handles installation and support according to the needs and infrastructure of usually small to medium enterprises.</p>"}, {"time": "39000", "image": "enpe8n3le02ob01re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<p>I have experience working for several companies. All of them, at some point, presented different problems related to IT. I remember one which had integration issues when new technologies were implemented; every time they had to look for the information in different databases, the information was duplicated. I also remember one of these companies never did backups of information. Omitting this important step generated them different difficult situations. If this is your case, you can implement a backup solution plan and adopt a data disaster recovery procedure. This way, you can avoid losing information when there is, for instance, a power outage or a server crash. There are other common mistakes. For example, not taking precautions about security risks or hackers and waiting until something breaks can seriously affect your company.</p>"}, {"time": "95000", "image": "enpe8n3le02ob01re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<p>There are different ways to solve these issues. You can hire a cloud service to store all your business&rsquo; information. It can help you to reduce costs if you are a start-up or have a small company. You have to do it as soon as possible to avoid having any problems in the near future. If you are thinking about hiring a consulting company, it can be a good idea. Some of them offer virtual help and you can request assessment on the specific issue you have to solve. Besides, they can give you different options to solve the problems you may have.</p>"}], "coverimg": "enpe8n3le02ob01re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "type": "scholar"}]}